WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Tap Download shortcut on the Necessary setup page.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
Confirm the download in Safari.

00:11.000 --> 00:20.000
Open Page Menu → Downloads, then tap the shortcut file.

00:20.000 --> 00:27.000
In Shortcuts, tap Set Up Shortcut.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
Tap Skip Setup to add the shortcut with Automation turned off.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.000
Tap Editor to view its actions.

00:38.000 --> 00:44.000
Choose your Wallet cards or Any Card, then tap Done.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.000
Expand the Wallet trigger using its arrow.

00:49.000 --> 00:54.000
Turn on Automation.

00:54.000 --> 00:57.262
Tap Back. Your changes are saved.
